/**
 * Phase 4 cutover config — NOT used by the preview deploy.
 *
 * Deploy command: `npm run deploy:production`
 *   = `astro build && wrangler deploy --config wrangler.production.jsonc`
 *
 * Differences from wrangler.jsonc (which serves the preview Worker), and why each
 * one matters at cutover:
 *
 *   - `name: hunter-alpha-hub-astro` — a **new** Worker. The Next Worker stays
 *     deployed and untouched so rollback is "move the domains back", not
 *     "rebuild the old app".
 *   - no preview stamp — `npm run deploy` (preview) injects `X-Robots-Tag:
 *     noindex`; running that against production would deindex the whole domain.
 *     `npm run check:files` fails the build if a noindex line is present.
 *   - `workers_dev: false` + `preview_urls: false` — the Astro Worker must not be
 *     reachable (and indexable) at *.<account>.workers.dev once it is the real
 *     site. The preview Worker keeps its own workers.dev URL for testing.
 *   - **only `www.hunteralphahub.com` is bound here.** The apex belongs to
 *     `hunter-alpha-hub-apex` (wrangler.apex.jsonc): this Worker is asset-first,
 *     so an apex request never reaches its script and the 308 has to live in a
 *     Worker that has no assets of its own. Until 2026-09-18 this file also
 *     declared the apex, which would have fought the apex Worker for the same
 *     hostname on the next deploy.
 *
 *   - Cloudflare refuses a custom-domain deploy while another Worker holds the
 *     hostname, which is what makes the cutover order matter: the hostnames were
 *     moved with the API option `override_existing_origin` (atomic, no window
 *     with no Worker attached), then this config was deployed to match.
 *
 *   - `assets` stays **asset-first** (no `run_worker_first`). Apex → www is NOT
 *     handled here: Workers Assets answer static files before this script runs, so
 *     an apex request never reaches the app. The fix is a second Worker bound to
 *     the apex host (`wrangler.apex.jsonc` → `npm run deploy:apex`), because
 *     `run_worker_first: true` was measured on 2026-09-18 and it silently dropped
 *     all 92 `_redirects` rules in exchange for that one redirect.
 */
{
  "$schema": "../node_modules/wrangler/config-schema.json",
  "name": "hunter-alpha-hub-astro",
  "account_id": "de677f38b96340f3a63a53e5044a1c98",
  "main": "dist/_worker.js/index.js",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-08-25",
  "compatibility_flags": ["nodejs_compat"],
  "workers_dev": false,
  "preview_urls": false,
  "assets": {
    "directory": "dist",
    "binding": "ASSETS",
    "html_handling": "drop-trailing-slash",
    "not_found_handling": "404-page"
  },
  "d1_databases": [
    {
      "binding": "DB",
      "database_name": "hunter-alpha-hub-subscribers",
      "database_id": "941d6f24-ecc4-4f45-bc3a-888d9b6df00e",
      "migrations_dir": "../d1/migrations"
    }
  ],
  "routes": [{ "pattern": "www.hunteralphahub.com", "custom_domain": true }]
}
